{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787963197656818162,"compiled_state":{"alias":"fightable-nirvanic-kitten","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"89f0a895ff40443e18c5458144054d1e7e498295c1b62baf2b00baca9625a04f","event_uuid":"aa662318-ec75-4471-b4a4-96f1512360d9","position":{"commit_sha":"2e745815b7f5a143a12db039ac24d5e5b767cb2d","position":"1787957548007819001-aa662318-ec75-4471-b4a4-96f1512360d9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"6d02f622cb98b4d101aebe0ae5feb00133b2b8c5ede5537c888cd3406192e1a2","event_uuid":"eaa20bb2-9e69-4d1b-915d-13d7f16b63b2","position":{"commit_sha":"c4048c82b4682a12c219c5acc6d8049f3c26290c","position":"1787957568715027001-eaa20bb2-9e69-4d1b-915d-13d7f16b63b2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787957548007819001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"eaa20bb2-9e69-4d1b-915d-13d7f16b63b2","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"dbca-97ac-ad96-4d6d"}],"description":"Discovered while fixing dbca-97ac-ad96-4d6d (potential-powellite-mouflon). Two additional sites raise a bare `WorkflowError`, so error_code_for still maps them to `llm_unavailable` even though neither is an LLM outage:\n\n1. src/rebar/llm/workflow/executor.py:541 — `raise WorkflowError(\"unknown scripted step {name!r} (not in the step registry)\")`. This is a caller/plan-authoring error (an unknown `uses:` step) — arguably `invalid_input`.\n2. src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor.py:475 — `raise WorkflowError(\"the editor front-end bundle is missing ...\")`. This is a local build/environment setup condition — neither `invalid_input` nor `not_found` cleanly fit; may warrant a new code or a different mapping.\n\nBoth are OUT OF SCOPE for dbca because each needs a NEW error-code design decision (what code should each map to?), which the operator directed to escalate rather than decide inline. The dbca fix deliberately left the bare `WorkflowError` base mapping to `llm_unavailable` to protect execute-time genuine LLM outages (AC3).\n\nAcceptance: decide the correct error code for each site (likely a new WorkflowError subclass per site, mirroring WorkflowNotFoundError), add tests through the actual surfaces proving the code, and keep execute-time outages mapping to llm_unavailable.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"35ab-f0e0-3e4a-4b72","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Two more bare WorkflowError sites misclassify as llm_unavailable (executor unknown-step, editor missing-bundle)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["aa662318-ec75-4471-b4a4-96f1512360d9","eaa20bb2-9e69-4d1b-915d-13d7f16b63b2"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787963197656818162,"uuid":"57bcaee7-3905-4533-9c74-1177ef1d7b7b"}